1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,500
[Music]

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,200
<i>Yesterday I saw a very</i>

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,900
<i>interesting film.</i>

4
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:12,000
- How was it?
- It was rather long.

5
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:15,800
PETER: On the 3rd of October
we're going to Berlin.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,500
We're meeting Dr. Schmidt
and his wife there.

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
The weather is supposed to be good,
e.g. sunny and warm.

8
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
(sighs) Hopefully it won't rain.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
The train leaves at eight o'clock

10
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:46,000
and arrives in the evening.

11
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Hopefully it won't rain.
